Bram rests his hammer beside the anvil. "Let the steel do its work. You look after the edge."
+ [How do repairs work?]
    "One gold for each missing point of durability. A weapon starts at twenty and wears by one for each attack. At zero, its weapon power is halved."
    -> END
+ [Which weapon can I use?]
    "Swords, wands and paired guns suit every race. Humans and Elves can equip bows; Giants can own them, but cannot equip them. No ammunition is needed yet."
    -> END
+ [Can I fight without a weapon?]
    "Your bare hands still work. Change equipment in town before you leave; a dungeon run keeps the setup you entered with."
    -> END
